---
import SupportingPhoto from './SupportingPhoto.astro';
import VideoCTA from '../ui/VideoCTA.astro';
import ChapterHeader from '../ui/ChapterHeader.astro';
---
<section id="polevolt" class="chapter">
      <div class="polevolt-editorial">
        <div class="polevolt-introduction">
          <div class="chapter-copy">
            <ChapterHeader number="05" date="2022" descriptor="SMART INFRASTRUCTURE" layout="hanging" />
            <h2>PoleVolt</h2>
            <div class="polevolt-headline-group">
              <h3>From smart kiosks to smart EV charging infrastructure.</h3>
              <div class="polevolt-story-cta"><VideoCTA label="WATCH POLEVOLT STORY" /></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="polevolt-summary">
            <p>Working with Duke Energy, UNC Charlotte, the City of Charlotte and the Centralina Regional Council, CityPost became part of a curbside experience integrating EV charging directly into light poles.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="media-slot polevolt-feature-photo">
          <SupportingPhoto file="polevolt-web.webp" alt="PoleVolt EV charger mounted to a light pole beside a parked electric vehicle" />
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>
